    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10509" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀντίσταθμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σταθμός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>counterpoising, balancing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Sph.</u>
					229c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσὸν ἀ. τῆς κεφαλῆς οὐκ ἐδέξαντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					5.29
				</span></i>
			: metaph., <i>in compensation for,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς πατὴρ ἀ. τοῦ θηρὸς ἐκθύσειε τὴν
					αὑτοῦ κόρην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					571
				</span></i>
			.</div>
